1058 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042 Wrote SQL queries to extract and transform ERP data from SYSPRO\054 building recurring Excel\055based reporting systems used by purchasing\054 sales\054 and inventory teams to support daily operational decision\055making\056\n\042 Automated a weekly Open Order Report system using SQL\054 Power Automate Cloud\054 and dynamic supplier\055level filtering logic\054 reducing manual reporting effort by 90\045\056\n\042 Defined KPI frameworks and developed reporting dashboards in DOMO and Excel\054 increasing leadership visibility into inventory consumption trends\054 order status\054 and gross margin exposure\056\n\042 Improved and stabilized the Lam Research consignment fulfillment process within SYSPRO\054 correcting inventory discrepancies\054 streamlining transaction flows\054 and formalizing written procedures to maintain data integrity\056\n\042 Supported Forecast2 MRP testing and implementation by validating ERP data structures\054 resolving BOM inconsistencies\054 and improving forecast accuracy inputs across purchasing and production workflows\056\n\042 Coordinated initial Vietnam production shipments by designing and documenting end\055to\055end manufacturing\054 labeling\054 logistics\054 and supplier portal workflows to support successful international order fulfillment\056\n\042 Conducted tariff exposure analysis by engaging with U\056S\056 regulatory authorities to model potential duty impacts and assess downstream margin implications prior to overseas expansion\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1059 0 R
     /Pg 1039 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
